board or building a front-end to  view the data my strength is in  understanding the algorithm which means  that I should be looking towards people  who are good at that too to compliment  me in my team and then finally identify  weaknesses in your sack  where are your barriers where your  readiness level barriers I talked to  somebody yesterday who developed some  really cool algorithms and they wanted  to have a really cool front-end to do  the visualizations and they're like but  we don't know how to do this we're kind  of like doing this thing where we're  hacking things together and we just  don't have the time to build out that  technology so if that's what you're if  those are your barriers you need to be  able to identify them and that's where  you should focus your hiring or your  your professional development  and then finally what are you asking  your data scientists in your  organization actually to do  are you using their best strengths are  you using them you know do you have  actually have people that can get you  through those barriers and communicate  with the people that you need to in your  organization to start building data  products that's really all that I have  thank you very much I think there's a  couple of minutes left for questions and  yeah hopefully this is will help some of  you bring your products and actually set  them loose in the world in a positive  way that makes a difference thank you  [Applause]
 

